{
  "title": "MVerb",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Algorithmic reverb",
        "based on Martin",
        "Eastwood's MVerb.",
        "",
        "Wide ambience with",
        "controllable early",
        "and late energy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "lines": [
        "Knobs 1-4: Damp,",
        "Density, Bandwidth,",
        "Decay",
        "",
        "Knobs 5-8: PreDly,",
        "Size, Gain, Mix",
        "",
        "Early Mix is a ninth",
        "param with no knob -",
        "it sits on the next",
        "page. 0..1, default",
        "0.75. It crossfades",
        "early reflections",
        "against the late",
        "tail: 1 is all tail,",
        "0 is reflections",
        "only.",
        "",
        "All params are 0..1",
        "except Gain, 0..1.5."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
